    </HEAD>
    <BODY TEXT="#000000" BGCOLOR="#FFFFFF">
        <font face="Arial,Geneva,Helvetica">
<p>&nbsp;
<p>
            <center>
                <font size="+2" color=red>
                    The Eloquence of the Sea's Silence
                </font>
            </center>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                <p>
                Tiny, silvery minnows dart! First here! Then there!<br>
                Playing hide-and- seek with golden sunbeams without a care!<br>
                Uncovered sand crabs swiftly dig in the soaking wet sand<br>
                To protect themselves from being grabbed by bill or hand!<br>
                Happy colored cocchinea clams snuggle close together<br>
                Holding on to each grain of sand as if it were a tether!<br>
                Uninhabited Whelks do somersaults as each wave laps up the beach<br>
                Only to be carried away by another wave leaving before my hands can reach!<br>
                I am again astounded by God's amazing aquatic creations<br>
                And the eloquence of their silence that speaks to me without hesitation<br>
                Assuring me in my emptiness of God's endless love and power<br>
                Encouraging me to be aware of His Presence in every second of each hour!<br>
                <p>
            </blockquote>
